window.products.push({"id":931051,"name":"500 Thread Count 100% Cotton Queen/Standard Pillow Cases Set of 2 - Pure Natural Cooling Pillow Cover for Sleeping, Quality Like Egyptian Cotton, Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618wVv0K21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4X MORE DURABLE THAN OTHER 100% COTTON PILLOWCASES: We use extra long staple cotton that is 35% longer and 45% stronger than regular cotton. The longer fiber doesn’t tug, pull, or break, making the pillow cases more resilient and long lasting. The bonus step in the process, mercerization, imparts a silk-like gloss and absorbs dye better to give a brighter, deeper color to the pillow cases, so they don’t fade or pill on the wash. LIGHT ON YOUR POCKET, SOFT ON YOUR HEAD: We are reasonably priced compared to other brands and offer a more luxurious and softer product. Our 500 thread count pillow cases standard size are light as air, cool, and breathable. The top sateen weave makes the fabric silky, similar to a five-star hotel pillow cover. This includes pillow cases queen size set of 2 measuring 21” x 32” to fit standard-size pillows that are 21” x 26”. Pair it with a matching sheet set from our home collection. FITS BETTER & FEELS THE BEST: High quality threads are sewn closely together for a heavier & luxurious pillow case. Overlock stitching prevents fraying or puckering at the edges. The pillow covers standard size are aptly sized to fit your pillows, and the envelope closures tuck the pillows inside for a clean, sophisticated look. Gotta love the details! ECO-FRIENDLY COTTON PILLOWCASES FOR SENSITIVE SKIN: Want to sleep better? Sleep on 100% cotton pillowcase. Unlike microfiber and other linens, cotton pillowcases are natural, cooling, and eco-friendly. We source pure cotton directly from the cotton plant that is grown without synthetics and GMOs. Our pillow protectors are certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX, which means no harmful dyes and textile chemicals are in your bed. DON’T LIKE OUR 100% COTTON PILLOWCASES? GET THE MONEY BACK: If you’re unhappy with our luxury bedding, let us know. We will offer a full return or refund within 30 days of purchase as per Amazon guidelines. If you're here looking for a gift for Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Weddings, Vacation, and Autumn Holidays, our egyptian cotton quality shams are a hot seller and loved by adults and kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618wVv0K21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayfair Linen","source_asin":"B0767DP2RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0767DP2RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0767DP2RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
