window.products.push({"id":931513,"name":"MyAprils Turkish Hand Towels for Bathroom | Kitchen Towel with Fringe, Decorative Bathroom Peshtemal Towel for Hand, Face, Hair, Tea, Dishcloth, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWuilmO9L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Turkish cotton towels, also known as Peshtemals, traditionally have been used in Turkish baths and homes for centuries. Peshtemals are authentic, stylish, versatile, and can be used for many purposes. With their contemporary and soft design, with a touch of tradition, MyAprils Turkish towels add an elegant value to your everyday living.    Features of MyAprils Turkish Towels ✔  100% Natural Turkish Cotton✔  Made in Turkey✔  Beautifully hand-loomed by talented local artisans.✔  Eco-friendly, naturally dyed. ✔  Lightweight, extremely soft, and more absorbent:✔  Quick to dry, easy to carry ✔  Unique & Luxurious Style ✔  Multipurpose:  Thanks to their quality and softness, it is possible to use anywhere you want.WHERE TO USE TURKISH HAND TOWELS★ Hand Towel- Face Towel- Gym Towel- Yoga Towel★ Kitchen Towel- Tea Towel- Dishcloth★ Guest Towel- Travel Towel ★ Baby Care HOW TO CARE: Wash it before first use. Gentle wash in cold or warm water with similar colors. Hang it to dry which is most recommended or tumble dry on low. Do not use bleach, harsh detergents, fabric softener. Use a warm iron to smooth out any unwanted wrinkles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWuilmO9L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyAprils","source_asin":"B0951BWYJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0951BWYJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0951BWYJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
