window.products.push({"id":931535,"name":"HYSapientia 26Qt Countertop Convection Oven, 8-In-1 Extra Large Air Fryer Toaster Oven, 1700W Stainless Steel Air Fryer Convection Toaster Oven Combo,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7fPe0nhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟[More features, and more experience]Compared with “single function” of traditional air fryers,we offer 8 preset digital functions: steak,rotissere,air fries,air roast pizza, convection bakes, convection broils, toasts, and dehydration. The temperature range of 160-450°F makes it easy to achieve a healthy, crispy, fried finish using less oil than traditional fryers – or no oil at all. Make better-for-you fries that are just as crispy and tasty, roast a whole chicken. 🍖[More fast and more healthy]1700W high-power and 360 ° air convection system cooking food can directly reduce the oil content by 75% compared with traditional deep frying, with crispy skin and juicy inside. Cook food efficiently in the healthiest way. Double Glass door heat insulation reduces heat loss effectively reduces preheat time. ETL listed for safety. 🍗[More intelligent and more convenient]Get rid of the trouble of traditional knob control, so that you can more accurately control the cooking method and temperature with LED screen.The Oven’s tube uses the design of 4 above and 2 below. Features NTC temperature probes and PID precise temperature control algorithm to keep the temperature in the cavity constant and ensure the stability of the heat during baking. 🍕[Bigger and more useful]We have a capacity of 26Qt.Larger than most air fryers on the market; we are 30%-60% larger in capacity. You can easily roast a large chicken, toast many slices of bread, cook a large batch of French fries, 20 chicken wings or bake a 9-inch pizza. 🍤[More accessories, and more services]equpped with 8 accessores (Fetch Rack, Crumb Tray, Bake Tray, Oven Rack,Air Fryer Basket,Rotisserie,Oven Gloves and Recipe). This air fryer combo can create more possibilities which means you’re able to cook more types of delicious with the recipe.HYSapientia provides you with a free electronic recipe.We also offer you 30-day returns","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7fPe0nhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYSapientia","source_asin":"B09VSQ7MWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSQ7MWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSQ7MWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
