window.products.push({"id":931629,"name":"Bride and Groom Set of 2 Personalized Mason Jars Drinking Mugs with Handle Personalized Custom Etched with Name and Date for Wedding © Custom Engraved","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718VQtVTZdL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Bride and Groom beautifully engraved design personalized with FIRST NAMES and a wedding DATE OR YEAR. Perfect Engagement, Bridal Shower or Wedding Day gift for a couple, husband and wife or any lover combination!   Personalized with first names and a wedding date. Artfully crafted in our Florida Keys Studio. A perfect gift for the classy couples, newlyweds, anniversary, Valentine's Day, or for yourself! We have a large selection of Custom engraved Drinking Glasses! To view them all, click on Custom-Engraved-Glasses-by-StockingFactory right under the title on top of the page. The design is laser engraved by our state of the art laser engraver directly into the glass and becomes permanently etched into the drinking glass. It will not wash or rub off, fade or peel - guaranteed best quality craftsmanship. Packed in gorgeous organza gift bag, ready to send as a gift! Set of of 2 Mason Jars. Color: Clear Glass. Size: 16 Ozs. High: 5.75\" Wide: 3.5\" Depth 3.5\" Dishwasher safe. Not for canning or for hot liquids. IMPORTANT : To get your set of Mason Jar Mugs PERSONALIZED: Configure personalization on the Customize Now Button and then checkout. If you need further assistance with personalization after you check out, then look at your Amazon orders and click CONTACT SELLER button on the order you placed with us and provide us with request there, we will be happy to assist with your persona SEE ADDITIONAL IMAGES for the product to determine handle direction and how we personalize these mason jars.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718VQtVTZdL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHRISTMAS-STOCKINGS-by-STOCKINGFACTORY","source_asin":"B00W0IIFKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W0IIFKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W0IIFKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":931630,"name":"Tbfit 2 Inch Premium Gel-Infused Memory Foam Mattress Topper Queen, Cooling & Ventilated Mattress Pad with Breathable Bamboo Cover, High Density & Com","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819U45AGS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BREATHABLE COOLING EXPERIENCE】Tbfit memory foam mattress topper queen is equipped with unique ventilation holes. And we have proved through many experiments that this kind of ventilation hole design can achieve an excellent air circulation effect. With numerous cooling gel particles, the cooling mattress topper quickly dissipates heat and reduces heat accumulation in the body. Enjoy our breathable, ventilated and cooling design, you will get quality sleep at night and have an energetic morning. 【SLEEPING IN LUXURY】Don't waste money to buy a new expensive mattress topper anymore! Our high-density mattress topper queen has excellent resilience, support, and durability. It can perfectly fit your body curve, adapt to all sleeping positions and relieve shoulder, back, hip, and joint pain. Save your money and try our firm mattress topper first to bring you a luxurious sleep experience! 【PREMIUM FRESH MEMORY FOAM】Tbfit gel queen bed topper is made of 40D high-density memory foam. Its service life is 3 years longer than that of an ordinary memory foam topper, and it is more resistant to collapse while maintaining softness. To solve the problem of memory foam’s smell, we optimized the production formula. After opening the package and ventilating the gel mattress topper queen for 72 hours, you will hardly smell similar unpleasant odors on other mattress toppers. 【DUAL FIXED DESIGN COVERN】Never adjust the topper frequently! This cooling mattress pad has a dual fixing design with a high friction breathable mesh bottom and 4 adjustable elastic straps so that it can be firmly fixed on the bed. The top of the cover is made of skin-friendly knitted fabric, with the softest touch. The newest weaving technology makes it durable, performs well, and can withstand multiple machine washes. It can bring you an unparalleled luxurious sleep experience. 【GUARANTEE & WARRANTY】Our memory foam mattress toppers are certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX Standard 100. It comes compressed and rolled in a box. Please wait 48-72 hours for fully expand. We are offering 3 years warranty with a unique Tbfit replacement plan. If there are any problems during your use, feel free to contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819U45AGS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tbfit","source_asin":"B09H2QS23B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H2QS23B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H2QS23B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
