window.products.push({"id":931792,"name":"100% Blackout Vertical Window Shades, 3.5inch Slat Fabric Thermal Insulated Energy Saving UV Protection Decoration Vertical Window Blinds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OZ-h-O+tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted vertical blinds will have a deduction taken of approximately 0.4\" to ensure a proper fit the window frame.Inside mounted blinds require a minimum frame depth of 2.4\" for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.4\" please select outside mount. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our window shade come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Reslats the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 0.4 \" as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Reslats the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 0.4 \" as your inside height when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 8\" to be the outside mount width. Step 2. If your window is french window, measure from 2.4\" above the top window frame to the place 0.4\" above the ground. If your window is windowsill window, measure from 2.4\" above the top window frame to the place 4 \" below the bottom window frame. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: 100% Blackout vertical window blinds Feature: Energy Saving, thermal insulated, uv protection Material: Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included for both inside mounting and outside mounting. OPEN OPTIONS: Option 1. Sinle open, you can choose select open to left or open to right depends on your decision after you get the product. Option 2. Opposite open, open and close from the middlle of the blinds, when you control the slats, the blade is going to the left and right the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OZ-h-O+tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LETAU","source_asin":"B081TZJM1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-931792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081TZJM1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081TZJM1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
